OL,3,ABurnham to send high-performing civil
OL,4,Aservants to mayoral offices
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh-performing civil servants will be
OL,7,Fsent to work in mayoral offices in
OL,8,FEngland, as part of the prime
OL,9,Fminister's efforts to transfer power
OL,10,Ffrom central government to local
OL,11,Fleaders.
OL,13,FThe pilot scheme, due to start in the
OL,14,Fautumn, will see every mayoral
OL,15,Fauthority get between five and 10 civil
OL,16,Fservants for a six to nine month
OL,17,Fperiod.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
