OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham to send high-performing civil
OL,4,Aservants to mayoral offices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 18 mayors will be able to request
OL,7,Fcivil servants with the particular
OL,8,Fskills they need and Prime Minister
OL,9,FAndy Burnham said the scheme would help
OL,10,Fcommunities "unleash and unlock their
OL,11,Fown potential".
OL,13,FThe announcement followed a virtual
OL,14,Fmeeting between local mayors and the
OL,15,Fprime minister, who was working from
OL,16,Fhis new No 10 North office in
OL,17,FManchester.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
